cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Replication package for "The Energy of Design-Pattern Compositions:
  A Controlled Study of Super-Additive Energy Interactions at Shared
  Polymorphic Call Sites in .NET 8"
message: If you use this package, please cite the associated paper.
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  Benchmark suite, raw per-run energy, time and hardware-counter
  measurements, JIT and kernel disassemblies, and analysis scripts for a
  controlled study of 26 multi-pattern compositions of seven Gang of Four
  design patterns in .NET 8, measured on two Intel machines under a
  compute-bound and a scattered memory-access workload.
keywords:
  - green software engineering
  - design patterns
  - software energy consumption
  - interface dispatch
  - Intel RAPL
  - .NET 8
  - empirical software engineering
license: MIT
license-url: https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT
authors:
  - name: Author list withheld for anonymous review
# For the camera-ready version, replace the entry above with one
# family-names / given-names pair per author, and add version,
# date-released, doi and repository-code once the package is archived
# on Zenodo.
